	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "GDEY0213B74 e-paper panel, display up, tail folded 180 degrees under the panel into a Hirose FH34SRJ-24S-0.5SH(50) (LCSC C324726). Pad n = panel pin n. Panel, its areas and the tail on Dwgs.User; the fold sticks out 3.3 mm past the panel edge. Assumes a 3 mm spacer under the panel (at least the connector height, 1.0 mm, plus clearance) and the bend 1.75 mm from the glass; the panel edge lands 5.9 mm from the connector origin, +-0.5 mm. Courtyard covers the connector and the tail, not the panel: parts under the panel must be lower than the spacer.")
	(tags "e-paper EPD GDEY0213B74 FPC FH34SRJ folded")
